{"seq":13,"trial_id":"shared-bot-scope-2026-11/openclaw-opus-none-mu-v031-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-14T14:47:12.529Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"ba1092ccba173ad9176f3337a7f3e2c69dd3e12a040fcd894158be5772afd3e9","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Dana, I checked all of Moss's notes I can see, which are the North and Central digests in the shared files. I found two ticket numbers for Quarrendon Freight Lines:\n\n• *#PD-4492*, from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell opened it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers at Dock Doors 14–18 in the Eau Claire yard weren't getting SMS bay assignments at the gatehouse kiosk. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the 5 Oct 04:00 shift went through fine. There was also an action item to make sure the kiosk logs get archived before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n• *#4419*, from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners couldn't read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing. That note has no date.\n\nSome things I left out:\n• The 14 Sep 2025 North pipeline digest talks about QFL (Thea's appointment time vs. gate arrival question) but gives no ticket number.\n• Tickets #4409 and #4412 and FR-882 in the Central handoffs digest are for Marrow accounts, not QFL.\n• Marcus's note about \"Quarendon Freightways\" (one r) is about a different company. Moss's cheat sheet says it isn't a customer, so I didn't use it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
